cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Brain Volumetrics Report
abstract: The report step of the Clinical Brain MRI Volumetrics workflow. Derives per-subject volumetrics
  (ICV, tissue fractions, asymmetry, WMH load, screening flags) from the upstream outputs and writes offline
  HTML reports with nilearn overlays, a cohort CSV and a metrics JSON.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-brain-volumetrics
license: Apache-2.0
